sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Vendor

    participant App as Vendor App
    participant API
    participant Identity
    participant VendorService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Admin
    participant Notification

    Vendor->>App: Submit Registration

    App->>API: POST /vendors

    API->>Identity: Validate Account

    Identity->>DB: Verify Identity

    DB-->>Identity: Valid

    API->>VendorService: Create Vendor

    VendorService->>DB: Save Vendor

    DB-->>VendorService: Vendor Created

    VendorService->>Notification: Notify Administrators

    Notification-->>Admin: Review Required

    VendorService-->>API: Registration Submitted

    API-->>App: 201 Created

    Note over Admin: Administrator reviews application

    Admin->>API: Approve Vendor

    API->>VendorService: Activate Vendor

    VendorService->>DB: Update Status

    DB-->>VendorService: Active

    VendorService->>Notification: Notify Vendor

    Notification-->>Vendor: Registration Approved